title: Startup Triple Ding Chime Disable
raw_community_title: Disables "do do do" chime on startup
category: Chimes and Horn
platform: Ranger (6G)
model_years: 2024+
trim: All
source_sheet: (2024+) 6G Ranger.xlsx
notes: 'FORScan Menu: Seatbelt Warning Market (Change USA to Europe)

  Trim: All [Confirmed: craigc (9/5/24) Lariat FX4]

  Can use Forscan easy mode to change this

  Bit 2 (add 2 to make silent, e.g. change 0 to 2)'
steps:
- module: IPC
  address: 720-01-02
  notes: 'suggest using non asbuilt to change this

    * Bit 2 (add 2 to make silent, e.g. change 0 to 2)

    FORScan Menu: Seatbelt Warning Market (Change USA to Europe)

    Trim: All [Confirmed: craigc (9/5/24) Lariat FX4]'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx x*xx xx--
    offset_hint: '+2'
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 1
      action: 1
      feature_name: Seatbelt Warning Market (SWM)
      target_state: SWM ECE
recipe_version: '1.1'
